{"seq":8,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:37:40.540Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"8c7ceb53c4efc675375d7b487878405755991e8a4b274a2dadd6db8fe4174ad6","actor":"assistant","via":"gbrain","tool":"gbrain.search","kind":"read","args":{"query":"Moss Strategic digest owner Vantorre"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"pages":["heldout/agent-notes/2026-09-30-strategic-digest","heldout/agent-notes/2026-08-03-strategic-digest","heldout/agent-notes/2025-03-10-strategic-digest","heldout/agent-notes/2025-07-07-strategic-digest","heldout/agent-notes/2026-05-04-strategic-digest","heldout/agent-notes/2025-12-01-strategic-digest","heldout/agent-notes/2026-04-27-strategic-digest","heldout/agent-notes/2025-09-15-strategic-digest","heldout/agent-notes/strategic-cheatsheet","heldout/notes/2026-06-01-strategic-qbr-plan","heldout/chats/2026-07-01-vantorre-seats-retraction","heldout/agent-notes/2026-05-03-strategic-sunday","heldout/chats/strategic-pod-banter"],"count":13,"latency_ms":353,"sources":["public","channel-strategic-pod","team-strategic-members"],"facts":[{"fact":"Ruth Calloway (ruth-calloway, Chief Revenue Officer; runs the Strategic Accounts pod) wrote in #strategic-pod on 2026-10-14 09:00: Per Moss's Strategic digests, who owns each Strategic account today: Vantorre Group, Vantorre Mobility, Orlavine Medical Supply and Quillfeather Outfitters? And on what date did Vantorre Group change hands? I am updating the board slide.","id":1,"source":"ruth-calloway, #strategic-pod, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"ruth-calloway"}
{"seq":9,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:37:47.563Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f42a5abf118db22a83c5dbe116fb4968d40ee9cb86c9e47ded7911b22def36f8","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's digests show. Two of the four have gaps.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato owns it now. The digests call it \"Nadia's old industrial account\" and, in August, \"Gideon's biggest account.\" It changed hands on **4 May 2026**. The 5/3 prep note says it changes hands \"tomorrow, 2026-05-04,\" and the 5/4 digest says the account was reassigned in the CRM that day.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The digests call it his fleet account, and the 5/4 digest says he also assumed management of it that day. The digests also called it \"Gideon's fleet account\" back in December 2025, so I can't tell whether 5/4 was a change for Mobility or only a note about it.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. The 9/30 digest calls it \"Gideon's medical account.\" The March 2025 digest called it Nadia's medical account, but I found no digest that names the date it moved.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** The digests don't name an owner. They only say \"the Strategic pod's retail account\" or \"outdoor account.\" Nadia volunteered to run a training session for it, but that doesn't establish ownership. Please confirm it in the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n\nThe digests mostly refer to accounts by owner instead of by name, so Gideon as owner of the first three is an inference from that phrasing. It's worth a quick check against the CRM."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
